# covers: 1 E5.2, 1a 3.6
# fixture: phase1a-late-entry
# 1-late-entry-b (with 1-late-entry-a): waits out of view while A walks to the keltir meadow and
# starts fighting, then walks in. The keltir spawns that arrive on its AOI entry must carry the
# fight's state (wounded HP, dead, or a later life), and the next hit on a wounded one must
# continue from the HP its spawn carried plus oracle-verified regen, minus damage.
#
# V5: the legacy fixed delay admitted B before A wounded the durable NPC (r9 ticks596/613).
# Observe the wound, leave AOI, then re-enter: A holds the wound until that handshake.
# Geometry, budget and independent regen oracle: Scripts/late-entry-v5-oracle.py.
nf.Login
nf.WaitFor connected 15
nf.EnterWorld
nf.WaitFor in_world 15
nf.ClickMove 20 60
nf.WaitFor own_at 20 60 1 65       # Manhattan bound80 tiles at V5 speed,3x +3s
nf.WaitFor players_in_view >= 1 30 # A, walking (0, 0) -> (40, 40) -> (80, 85)
nf.WaitFor players_in_view == 0 60 # A crossed x = 64
nf.ClickMove 70 90                 # 31.6 tiles from the keltir_a home: no keltir (15-tile leash, 6-tile aggro) reaches it
nf.WaitFor own_at 70 90 1 65       # Manhattan bound80 tiles at V5 speed,3x +3s
nf.Target template:keltir_durable
nf.WaitFor target != none 3
nf.WaitFor target_wounded 90
nf.ClickMove 62 90
nf.WaitFor players_in_view == 0 15
nf.WaitFor own_at 62 90 1 15
nf.ClickMove 70 90
nf.WaitFor own_at 70 90 1 15
nf.Target template:keltir_durable
nf.WaitFor target != none 3
nf.WaitFor spawns_mid_fight >= 1 10
nf.WaitFor late_spawn_projection_ok >= 1 3   # the projection shows the wounded spawn's HP and life
nf.Expect late_spawn_projection_bad == 0
# The replay gate proves exact first-hit continuity including regeneration BEFORE an impact
# on the same tick (the wire emits final VitalsChanged, not that intermediate HP).
# It also REQUIRES the durable NPC's baseline AttackStarted after all identity spawns,
# with matching lives and native start < re-entry < impact, preserving impact/ready ticks
# (C2/design-review-2 finding1; state_runtime_observe.rs:185-199).
nf.Mark
nf.WaitFor target_hits_since_mark >= 1 15
nf.Expect target_wounded
# replay-gate: late_entry_hp_continuity keltir_durable
nf.ClickMove 62 90
nf.WaitFor players_in_view == 0 15
nf.Expect attacked_by == 0
nf.Within 480
